MSG_ABOUT_BODY (66//)
GitFetch %s (%s)\nFetch releases from GitHub on AmigaOS\n\nby Mathieu Burgerhout\n\nWith thanks to:\n  Jens Maus and everyone behind AmiSSL\n  Amiga Cafe - https://amiga.cafe\n  RVO, for my Amiga revival\n  Darren Banfi, whose Mint projects started this\n  and every (vibe) coder still keeping our\n  old girlfriend alive\n\n(c) 2026 Mathieu Burgerhout\n\nConnection: %s
